# Calling chi on a riichi discard emits reach_accepted first and cancels ippatsu
# (engine.md §4.1 rows 3/7, §4.2, §6, rules.md §4.26).
# Seat 0 declares double riichi and discards 2m.
# Seat 1 calls chi:34m -> reach_accepted(0) precedes chi(1), and Seat 0's ippatsu is cancelled.
# Seat 1 discards 7s -> Seat 0 rons 7s WITHOUT ippatsu!
# Scoring for Seat 0 (dealer, East):
#   Hand: 567m 234p 678p 56s 88m + ron 7s (dora ind 1z, ura ind 1z -> 0 dora)
#   Yaku: double_riichi (2) + pinfu (1) + tanyao (1) = 4 han 30 fu (NO ippatsu!)
#   Dealer 4 han 30 fu = 11600 (no kiriage mangan; with ippatsu it would be 12000).
#   Seat 0 recovers its own 1000 stick: net deltas +11600 -11600 0 0.

[meta]
name: riichi_discard_chi_cancels_ippatsu
title: Chi on a riichi discard emits reach_accepted before chi and cancels ippatsu
rules: mahjongsoul
source: engine.md §4.1 rows 3/7, §4.2, §6, rules.md §4.26

[round]
